title: "Bioimage Analysis Notebooks: From Pixels to U-Net"
abstract: >-
  Educational Jupyter notebooks that teach bioimage analysis, from pixels and
  color spaces through classical spot detection to training a U-Net, using
  ecDNA detection in FISH microscopy images as the running example.
